SUMMARY:Cuberow
DESCRIPTION:Cuberow (Coo-bur-oh) is a duo comprised of Billy Presnell and Melissa Autumn Raines. Their music spans genres but can best be described as Soulful Indie Acoustic with layers of Funk and Americana. Both players come together\, blending haunting harmonies and rich vocals over Presnell’s dynamic and percussive guitar style\, to produce an array of heartfelt originals and covers.
