SUMMARY:Justin Ray Trio
DESCRIPTION:Trumpeter Justin Ray brings his trio to the stage alongside Tim Fischer on guitar and Zack Page on bass for an evening of world-class jazz. \nA Berklee College of Music graduate\, Justin has performed with artists including Michael Bublé\, Kurt Elling\, Dave Weckl\, Kamasi Washington\, and more. During his nearly 20 years with Michael Bublé’s band\, he toured internationally\, appeared on Grammy-winning recordings\, and performed at iconic venues including Madison Square Garden\, the Hollywood Bowl\, Radio City Music Hall\, and the Sydney Opera House. Now based in Asheville\, Justin is also an acclaimed composer\, arranger\, and educator whose performances blend virtuosic musicianship with deep jazz tradition. \n$10 weekdays -$15 weekends at the door (all ticket proceeds are 100% passed to the band\, backed by a living wage guarantee from Hotel Eve) \n*Reserve a table in advance\, or join us impromptu the night of the show. Reservations/advance tickets are recommended for preferred seating\, but not required. Tickets are available at the door on a first-come\, first-served basis.  Event Details and Tickets \nHotel Eve is your locally rooted\, speakeasy jazz club & cocktail bar\, hidden in the heart of Downtown Asheville. Mysteriously not a hotel…check in for spirits\, souls and jazz! We’re tucked away\, on purpose. You’ll find us behind the gate nestled between Virtue Boutique and Dane Wells Gallery at 56 N Lexington Avenue in downtown Asheville. Step through\, take a left into the courtyard\, check in for Spirits\, Souls & Jazz. We’ll be waiting on the other side. hotelevejazz.com \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/justin-ray-trio/
LOCATION:Hotel Eve Jazz\, 56 N Lexington Avenue\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
